  "description": "Bennetstown is a modern new community in the thriving town of Dunboyne, Co. Meath. Combining contemporary homes with the character of an established town, Dunboyne offers a welcoming atmosphere, a strong sense of community and a wide range of local services. Residents can enjoy the convenience of nearby shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, parks and recreational facilities, all within easy reach of home. \n\nBennetstown is ideally positioned for easy access to Dublin city centre, Navan and Maynooth. The development benefits from excellent road connectivity, with the M3 and M50 motorways just minutes away. For those travelling by public transport, regular bus services and nearby rail connections provide convenient access to Dublin and surrounding areas, making commuting and everyday travel simple and stress-free. \n\nMost homes in this exciting new development are expected to be available from early December, with the remaining four one-bedroom units anticipated to become available in late January. \n\nAll CGI visuals, images and technical descriptions are provided for illustrative purposes only and reflect the current design intent. Final installations, equipment specifications, layouts and site finishes may vary during the construction process. \n\nA deposit is required upfront to secure tenancy. Applicants are encouraged to upload all correct supporting documentation at the point of submission. \n\nApplication closing date will be announced 7 days in advance.",
